    {"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Hotel","name":"Kaldan Samudhra Palace, a Palace by the Sea","url":"https://www.agoda.com/en-in/kaldan-samudhra/hotel/chennai-in.html","image":"//pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/29418285/-1/a2a050c001cd2897c6c1a94f7828f343.jpg?ca=29&ce=0&s=1024x768","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressCountry":"India","addressLocality":"Mahabalipuram","addressRegion":"Mamallapuram","postalCode":"603103","streetAddress":"16/3B1B, Devaneri, East Coast Road, Mamallapuram, Chengulpet "},"description":"Exceptional Entertainment Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a diverse range of entertainment facilities designed to enhance your stay with comfort and enjoyment. Guests can unwind and rejuvenate at the luxurious spa, complete with massage and steamroom services, providing the perfect escape for relaxation. For those seeking leisure and fun, the games room offers a variety of entertainment options, while the library provides a peaceful retreat for book lovers. In the evenings, guests can indulge in lively karaoke sessions, creating memorable moments with friends and family.\n\nAdditionally, the palace features a stylish bar and a well-appointed salon, ideal for grooming and socializing in a sophisticated setting. For a touch of local charm and souvenirs, the gift shop offers a curated selection of keepsakes to remember your stay. The beautifully maintained garden provides a serene outdoor space to relax and enjoy the natural surroundings. Kaldan Samudhra Palace truly combines relaxation and entertainment, ensuring a delightful experience for every guest.Exceptional Sports and Recreation Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a range of impressive sports and recreational amenities designed to enhance your stay. Guests can enjoy a state-of-the-art free fitness center, equipped with modern equipment to help you stay active and healthy during your visit. For those seeking relaxation and leisure, the outdoor pool provides a refreshing escape, perfect for unwinding under the sun. Additionally, guests have exclusive access to a pristine private beach, ideal for swimming, sunbathing, or simply enjoying the tranquil coastal scenery.\n\nFor a touch of fun and friendly competition, the hotel features a dart board, allowing guests to engage in entertaining indoor games. The expansive beach area invites visitors to indulge in various beach activities or take leisurely strolls along the shoreline. Whether you're looking to stay fit, relax by the water, or enjoy some playful entertainment, Kaldan Samudhra Palace’s diverse sports facilities cater to all your recreational needs, promising an active and enjoyable stay.Convenience Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a range of exceptional convenience facilities designed to enhance your stay. Guests can enjoy the comfort of free Wi-Fi available in all rooms and public areas, ensuring seamless connectivity throughout your visit. For added convenience, the hotel provides 24-hour room service and daily housekeeping, allowing you to relax and enjoy a clean, well-maintained environment at any time.\n\nTravelers can take advantage of the express check-in and check-out services, along with luggage storage options, making your arrival and departure smooth and hassle-free. The hotel also features a laundromat and laundry services to keep your wardrobe fresh, as well as safety deposit boxes for your valuables. For those who smoke, a designated smoking area is available. Additionally, a dedicated concierge service is on hand to assist with your needs, ensuring a comfortable and convenient stay at Kaldan Samudhra Palace.Convenient Transport Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers guests a seamless travel experience with its comprehensive transport facilities. Upon arrival, guests can enjoy the convenience of airport transfer services, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free journey from the airport to the hotel. For those arriving by car, the hotel provides ample car parking options, including a dedicated valet parking service for added convenience and security. Guests can also take advantage of the complimentary car park, allowing for easy and cost-effective parking during their stay.Exceptional Dining Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a delightful array of dining options designed to cater to every guest's preference. Guests can indulge in a hearty breakfast buffet or enjoy a continental breakfast to start their day on a refreshing note. The hotel’s halal restaurant ensures that guests seeking Halal cuisine can dine comfortably and confidently, savoring a variety of flavorful dishes in a welcoming environment.\n\nFor added convenience, the hotel features a cozy coffee shop where guests can unwind with aromatic coffee and light snacks. Whether you're craving a quick caffeine fix or a leisurely meal, the 24-hour room service provides round-the-clock culinary delights right in the comfort of your room. Daily housekeeping ensures that your dining and living spaces remain pristine, enhancing your overall stay at Kaldan Samudhra Palace.Elegant Room Options at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a diverse selection of rooms designed to cater to various preferences and group sizes. Guests can choose from the cozy Deluxe Twin Room, spanning 33 square meters with two single beds, or indulge in the spacious Deluxe King Pool Facing, which provides 45 square meters of comfort with a luxurious king-sized bed overlooking the pool. For those seeking an elevated experience, the Premium King First Floor Pool Facing offers 46 square meters of elegant living space with a stunning pool view, while the Executive Palace Suite on the ground floor provides an expansive 82 square meters of luxury with direct pool access.\n\nFor larger groups or families, the hotel features the Premium Palace Suite on the first floor, a