views in order to provide a more accurate and up to date summary.",howReviewsWorkText:"How reviews work",howReviewsWorkHeading1Text:"Guest reviews standards",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description1Text:"We believe genuine reviews submitted by fellow travelers provide some of the best information to help you and others make future bookings. To ensure that all reviews on the platform are relevant, helpful, and genuine, we employ strict guidelines and quality control.",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description2Text:"Each review score is between 1 and 10. Guests can give a separate ‘sub-score’ in crucial areas, including Value for money, Location, Cleanliness, Staff, and Facilities. The calculated overall score is simply an average of the sub-scores. When a review is partially submitted, we ignore the data for all sub-scores not given. A property's overall review score may affect how it is displayed, including its position in search results and sorting order on the platform.",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description3Text:"We sometimes show external review scores from other well-known travel websites, but we always make it clear when we do this – for instance, reviews from Booking.com appear under a separate section of our website. We do not include sponsored reviews within our reviews.",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description4Text:"To make sure reviews are relevant, we may only accept reviews that are submitted within 12 months of checking out. Reviews may remain displayed for up to 10 years.",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description5Text:"We may stop showing reviews associated with customer accounts that have been inactive for a period exceeding 10 years, or if the accommodation has a change of ownership.",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Text:"Reviews that breach our guidelines in the following areas may be removed or not published:",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point1Text:"Dangerous and disrespectful content",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point1SubPoint1Text:"Hate, discrimination and harassment speech?",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point1SubPoint2Text:"Violent, offensive and restricted content?",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point1SubPoint3Text:"Animal Welfare",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point1SubPoint4Text:"Content of a sexual nature",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point1SubPoint5Text:"Commercial or Promotional content",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point2Text:"Spam, misleading content, and deceptive practices",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point3Text:"Intellectual property, privacy, and confidential data",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point4Text:"Non-stayed reservations",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point5Text:"Images and editorial guidelines (please refer to the below relevant section)",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description6Point6Text:"Scams and Fraud",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description7Text:"When you see multiple reviews, the most recent ones will be at the top, subject to a few other factors, (what language a review is in, whether it’s just a rating or contains comments as well, etc.). If you like, you can sort and/or filter them by date, review score, etc.",howReviewsWorkHeading1Description8Text:"Reviews may contain translations powered by Google. Google disclaims all warranties related to the translations, express or implied, including any warranties of accuracy, reliability and any implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Text:"Agoda Review Guidelines",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description1Text:"Our guidelines and the content standards below aim to keep the content relevant and appropriate for a global audience, but without limiting expression of strong opinions. They’re applicable regardless of the positive or negative sentiment of the comment.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description2Text:"Contributions should be travel related",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description2ContinuedText:"the most helpful contributions are detailed and help others make better, informed decisions. Don’t include personal, political, ethical, or religious commentary. Promotional content will be removed and issues concerning our services should be routed to our Customer Service team.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description3Text:"Contributions should be appropriate for a global audience",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description3ContinuedText:"comments and media that include 'hate speech', discriminatory remarks, threats, sexually explicit remarks, violence, and the promotion of illegal activity are not permitted.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description4Text:"Respect intellectual property",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description4ContinuedText:"ensure that you own or have the right to use any intellectual property rights that might exist in the content you post, particularly images.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description5Text:"We are committed to maintaining a safe and lawful environment for all users – the uploading, generating, or sharing of illegal content on this website is strictly prohibited.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description6Text:"All content should be genuine and unique to the guest",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description6ContinuedText:"only certified guests who have booked through Agoda, stayed at the reviewed property and did not cancel their booking, are invited to submit a review. Whether negative or positive, we will post every comment in full and as quickly as possible after being moderated, to comply with our Guest Review Guidelines.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description7Text:"Reviews that contain text copied from another source, or which contain the opinions of anyone other than the writer, will be rejected.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description8Text:"Our property partners must not post on behalf of guests or offer incentives in exchange for reviews. Attempts to lower the rating of a competitor by submitting a negative review won’t be tolerated.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description9Text:"If we find any fake reviews, we delete them and, if necessary, act against whoever is responsible. Anyone who spots something unusual can always report it to our Customer Service team, and our fraud team will investigate.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description10Text:"To edit a review you’ve already submitted, please contact our Customer Service team.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description11Text:"Relevant and balanced",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description11ContinuedText:"when writing a review, include all the information you’d want to know when deciding where to book your next stay. Describe the room, facilities, services, surroundings, or anything related to the property that can be useful to others.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description12Text:"Your review should be based on your own experience only. We respect your viewpoint. Be honest, but fair. Both positive and negative accounts get posted but try to stay constructive and avoid rants.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description13Text:"Avoid specific information such as rates and room numbers.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description14Text:"Respect the privacy of others",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description14ContinuedText:"refrain from including personal data (for example, names, identifiable images of individuals, contact details, or location data) or any content that you do not have permission to share and other information regarding other persons in your posts. If your submission nonetheless contains personal data, you agree that such personal data will be processed by Agoda in accordance with Agoda’s Privacy Policy and applicable data protection laws.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description15Text:"Readable and respectful",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description15ContinuedText:"Keep it clean. Spammy content, gibberish, hyperlinks, HTML tags, and duplicates are not permitted and will be removed. We won’t fix your typos, so please proofread your own writing. \n\nPeople of all ages, nationalities, cultures, and religions read our reviews. Agoda will not post profanity, discriminatory comments, personal attacks, or references to sexual or drug-related activities.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description16Text:"Images and editorial guidelines",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description16ContinuedText:"photos and images are a valuable resource on our platform. In order to be helpful to our community, they need to be useful, informative, and related to the actual travel experience.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description17Text:"We don’t allow:",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description17Point1Text:"Images that don’t relate to the actual travel experience.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description17Point2Text:"Images that contain intellectual property, private, and confidential data",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description17Point3Text:"Images that contain content of a sexual nature",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description17Point4Text:"Images that contain hate, discrimination, and harassment",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description17Point5Text:"Images that contravene any of the policies, standards or guidelines included here.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description18Text:"Reviews are not a place for allegations, accusations, or legal issues. If you do have a legal issue, such as theft or suspicion of other illegal activity, please contact our Customer Support team, which is available around the clock. Don’t hesitate to contact us!",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description19Text:"Agoda may edit or reject reviews that do not conform to these guidelines, and additionally reserves the right to translate, adjust, or remove reviews at its sole discretion. ",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description20Text:"Thanks for sharing your experience! You can find more information",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description20LinkText:"here.",howReviewsWorkHeading2Description20LinkHref:"https://www.agoda.com/info/eu-digital-services-act.html?ds=o0LmQqowgeX%2BxJkB#:~:text=to%20put%20first.-,Content%20Guidelines,-1.%20Overview",howReviewsWorkHeading3Text:"Appealing a moderation decision",howReviewsWorkHeading3Description1Text:"When we remove a review or other content item you've posted, we'll make sure to tell you why in a simple message. You can then edit your content to meet the standards set out in our guidelines or appeal the decision to remove your content if you don’t agree with our moderation decision.",howReviewsWorkHeading4Text:"The appeal process",howReviewsWorkHeading4Description1Text:"Once you’ve received a notification that states why your content was removed, you’ll be able to appeal the decision within 6 months after receiving it. To start the appeal, you can follow the link provided in the email letting you know your content was removed.",howReviewsWorkHeading4Description2Text:"When you appeal the decision, our content moderators will review your content against our content guidelines once more and decide whether the content is appropriate to display on our platform. You’ll be notified of the outcome of our review by email.",includeRoomPrice:"**Included** in room price:",notIncludeRoomPrice:"**Not included** in room price:",priceDoNotInclude:"Prices do not include taxes & fees",doNotInclude:"Does not include taxes & fees",priceInclude:"Prices include taxes & fees",include:"Includes taxes and fees",extrabedNotIncludeInRoomPrice:"Extra bed not included in room price\t",extrabedIncludeInRoomPrice:"Extra bed included in room price\t",extrabedPriceToBeAddedAtCheckout:"+{0} to be added at checkout for {1} required extra bed(s)",extrabedPriceIncluded:"including {0} for required {1} extra bed(s)",bedConfigurationTitle:"Bed preference (if available)",moreRoomAmenitiesButton:"See all room facilities",seeRoomDetails:"See room details",seeRoomDetailsArialabel:"{0} for {1}",viewMatterPortArialabel:"View 3D Photo of {0}",originalPriceText:"Original price: {0}",backButtonLabel:"Go back",propertyImageFallbackAltText:"Property image {0}",roomGridShowLessRooms:"Show less",roomGridShowMoreRooms:"See all offers",roomGridShowNOffers:"Show {0} more deals",roomGridShowOneMoreDeal:"Show 1 more deal",roomGridShowMoreNRoomOffer:"Show {0} more room offer",roomGridShowM