    {"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Hotel","name":"Kaldan Samudhra Palace, a Palace by the Sea","url":"https://www.agoda.com/en-in/kaldan-samudhra/hotel/chennai-in.html","image":"//pix8.agoda.net/hotelImages/29418285/-1/a2a050c001cd2897c6c1a94f7828f343.jpg?ca=29&ce=0&s=1024x768","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressCountry":"India","addressLocality":"Mahabalipuram","addressRegion":"Mamallapuram","postalCode":"603103","streetAddress":"16/3B1B, Devaneri, East Coast Road, Mamallapuram, Chengulpet "},"description":"Exceptional Entertainment Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a diverse range of entertainment facilities designed to enhance your stay with comfort and enjoyment. Guests can unwind and rejuvenate at the luxurious spa, complete with massage and steamroom services, providing the perfect escape for relaxation. For those seeking leisure and fun, the games room offers a variety of entertainment options, while the library provides a peaceful retreat for book lovers. In the evenings, guests can indulge in lively karaoke sessions, creating memorable moments with friends and family.\n\nAdditionally, the palace features a stylish bar and a well-appointed salon, ideal for grooming and socializing in a sophisticated setting. For a touch of local charm and souvenirs, the gift shop offers a curated selection of keepsakes to remember your stay. The beautifully maintained garden provides a serene outdoor space to relax and enjoy the natural surroundings. Kaldan Samudhra Palace truly combines relaxation and entertainment, ensuring a delightful experience for every guest.Exceptional Sports and Recreation Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a range of impressive sports and recreational amenities designed to enhance your stay. Guests can enjoy a state-of-the-art free fitness center, equipped with modern equipment to help you stay active and healthy during your visit. For those seeking relaxation and leisure, the outdoor pool provides a refreshing escape, perfect for unwinding under the sun. Additionally, guests have exclusive access to a pristine private beach, ideal for swimming, sunbathing, or simply enjoying the tranquil coastal scenery.\n\nFor a touch of fun and friendly competition, the hotel features a dart board, allowing guests to engage in entertaining indoor games. The expansive beach area invites visitors to indulge in various beach activities or take leisurely strolls along the shoreline. Whether you're looking to stay fit, relax by the water, or enjoy some playful entertainment, Kaldan Samudhra Palace’s diverse sports facilities cater to all your recreational needs, promising an active and enjoyable stay.Convenience Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a range of exceptional convenience facilities designed to enhance your stay. Guests can enjoy the comfort of free Wi-Fi available in all rooms and public areas, ensuring seamless connectivity throughout your visit. For added convenience, the hotel provides 24-hour room service and daily housekeeping, allowing you to relax and enjoy a clean, well-maintained environment at any time.\n\nTravelers can take advantage of the express check-in and check-out services, along with luggage storage options, making your arrival and departure smooth and hassle-free. The hotel also features a laundromat and laundry services to keep your wardrobe fresh, as well as safety deposit boxes for your valuables. For those who smoke, a designated smoking area is available. Additionally, a dedicated concierge service is on hand to assist with your needs, ensuring a comfortable and convenient stay at Kaldan Samudhra Palace.Convenient Transport Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers guests a seamless travel experience with its comprehensive transport facilities. Upon arrival, guests can enjoy the convenience of airport transfer services, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free journey from the airport to the hotel. For those arriving by car, the hotel provides ample car parking options, including a dedicated valet parking service for added convenience and security. Guests can also take advantage of the complimentary car park, allowing for easy and cost-effective parking during their stay.Exceptional Dining Facilities at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a delightful array of dining options designed to cater to every guest's preference. Guests can indulge in a hearty breakfast buffet or enjoy a continental breakfast to start their day on a refreshing note. The hotel’s halal restaurant ensures that guests seeking Halal cuisine can dine comfortably and confidently, savoring a variety of flavorful dishes in a welcoming environment.\n\nFor added convenience, the hotel features a cozy coffee shop where guests can unwind with aromatic coffee and light snacks. Whether you're craving a quick caffeine fix or a leisurely meal, the 24-hour room service provides round-the-clock culinary delights right in the comfort of your room. Daily housekeeping ensures that your dining and living spaces remain pristine, enhancing your overall stay at Kaldan Samudhra Palace.Elegant Room Options at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceKaldan Samudhra Palace offers a diverse selection of rooms designed to cater to various preferences and group sizes. Guests can choose from the cozy Deluxe Twin Room, spanning 33 square meters with two single beds, or indulge in the spacious Deluxe King Pool Facing, which provides 45 square meters of comfort with a luxurious king-sized bed overlooking the pool. For those seeking an elevated experience, the Premium King First Floor Pool Facing offers 46 square meters of elegant living space with a stunning pool view, while the Executive Palace Suite on the ground floor provides an expansive 82 square meters of luxury with direct pool access.\n\nFor larger groups or families, the hotel features the Premium Palace Suite on the first floor, also with 82 square meters of space and pool-facing views. Guests desiring more privacy and space can opt for the Studio Villa on the ground floor, offering 92 square meters of comfort with a private setting. The most spacious option is the Luxury 3 Bedroom Villa, covering 132 square meters and equipped with three king-sized beds, perfect for extended stays or family vacations. Booking these rooms through Agoda ensures you receive the best prices available, along with a seamless, hassle-free reservation process that makes planning your stay simple and enjoyable.Discover the Ancient Marvels of MahabalipuramNestled along the stunning coastline of Mamallapuram, India, lies the enchanting town of Mahabalipuram. Renowned for its rich cultural heritage and awe-inspiring ancient architecture, this UNESCO World Heritage Site is a must-visit destination for history buffs and art enthusiasts alike.\n\nStep back in time as you explore the magnificent rock-cut temples, monolithic sculptures, and intricately carved bas-reliefs that adorn the town. The iconic Shore Temple, with its breathtaking views of the Bay of Bengal, is a true masterpiece of Dravidian architecture. Marvel at the grandeur of the Five Rathas, monolithic rock temples shaped like chariots, each dedicated to a different deity.\n\nBeyond its architectural wonders, Mahabalipuram offers a serene and picturesque setting. Take a leisurely stroll along the pristine beaches, where you can witness local fishermen casting their nets or simply soak in the tranquil ambiance. Indulge in delicious seafood delicacies at the beachside shacks, offering a taste of the region's culinary delights.\n\nImmerse yourself in the vibrant local culture by visiting the bustling street markets, where you can find exquisite handicrafts, stone sculptures, and traditional silk sarees. Don't miss the opportunity to witness the traditional dance forms of Bharatanatyam and Kathakali, performed by talented artists at the town's cultural centers.\n\nWhether you are seeking a journey through history, a relaxing beach getaway, or an exploration of traditional Indian culture, Mahabalipuram has something to offer every traveler. With its fascinating attractions and idyllic surroundings, this ancient town is sure to leave a lasting impression on your heart and mind.Getting to Kaldan Samudhra Palace from the Nearest AirportsWelcome to Kaldan Samudhra Palace, a magnificent retreat nestled in the heart of Mahabalipuram, Mamallapuram, India. To reach this enchanting destination, you have a few options from the nearest airports.\n\nIf you're arriving at Chennai International Airport, which is approximately 58 kilometers away from Kaldan Samudhra Palace, you can choose between taxis, private transfers, or public transportation. Taxis and private transfers offer the convenience of a direct journey, allowing you to sit back and enjoy the scenic drive. Alternatively, if you're looking for a more budget-friendly option, you can take a local bus or a train from Chennai to Mahabalipuram, and then hire a rickshaw or taxi to reach the palace.\n\nAnother nearby airport is Pondicherry Airport, located around 100 kilometers away from Kaldan Samudhra Palace. From here, you can also opt for taxis, private transfers, or public transportation to reach your destination. The journey from Pondicherry Airport to Mahabalipuram takes approximately 2 hours, offering you ample time to soak in the picturesque landscapes of Tamil Nadu.\n\nNo matter which airport you choose to arrive at, once you reach Kaldan Samudhra Palace, you'll be greeted by its exquisite architecture, lush gardens, and serene ambiance. This luxurious palace offers a perfect blend of modern amenities and traditional charm, ensuring a truly memorable stay in Mamallapuram, India.Discover the Rich Cultural Heritage of Mamallapuram at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceNestled in the heart of Mamallapuram, Kaldan Samudhra Palace offers a prime location surrounded by a wealth of cultural landmarks and attractions. Immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere of this ancient town as you explore the nearby landmarks.\n\nJust a short distance away from the hotel, you'll find the famous Descent of the Ganges, a magnificent rock-cut monument that showcases intricate carvings depicting Hindu mythology. Marvel at the detailed sculptures and reliefs that adorn this UNESCO World Heritage Site, offering a glimpse into the rich artistic heritage of the region.\n\nFor a unique experience, venture to Tiger Cave, a rock-cut Hindu temple known for its awe-inspiring architecture and intricate carvings. As you explore the temple complex, you'll be captivated by the serene ambiance and the beautiful surrounding landscapes.\n\nIf you're looking to delve deeper into the history of Mamallapuram, make sure to visit Ganesha Ratha, a monolithic rock-cut temple dedicated to Lord Ganesha. Admire the intricate carvings and architectural marvels that make this temple a true gem.\n\nWith its convenient location, Kaldan Samudhra Palace allows you to easily access these landmarks and more, ensuring an unforgettable stay immersed in the rich cultural heritage of Mamallapuram.Indulge in a Gastronomic AdventureAt Kaldan Samudhra Palace, you will find yourself surrounded by an array of delightful dining options. From the aromatic flavors of Arabian cuisine at ARABIAN GARDEN MULTI CUISINE RESTAURANT and the fresh seafood delights at Arabian garden seafood restaurant, to the authentic South Indian dishes at Sri Ananda Bhavan and the mouthwatering Indian and Chinese fusion at Wok To Dhaba Restaurant, there is something to satisfy every palate. For those craving international flavors, Moonrakers Restaurant offers a diverse menu with dishes from around the world. If you prefer traditional Chettinad cuisine, head to Virunthombal Chettinadu, where you can savor the rich and spicy flavors of this regional specialty. For a taste of pure vegetarian fare, The Golden Palate (Pure Vegetarian Restaurant) - Hotel Mamallaa Heritage is the perfect choice. And if you're in the mood for a beachside dining experience, Santana Beach Restaurant offers a picturesque setting with breathtaking views of the ocean. Whether you're a food enthusiast or simply looking to indulge in a memorable meal, the surrounding restaurants near Kaldan Samudhra Palace will leave you satisfied and craving for more.Shop 'til you drop in MamallapuramLocated just a stone's throw away from Kaldan Samudhra Palace, you'll find an array of shopping landmarks to satisfy your retail therapy cravings. JK Bookshop is a haven for bookworms, offering a wide selection of books ranging from bestsellers to rare finds. Art enthusiasts will be delighted to explore Srinithi Art Gallery, which showcases exquisite artworks and handicrafts created by local artists. Apollo Books is another must-visit destination for book lovers, featuring a vast collection of books on various genres. For those looking to bring home a piece of Mamallapuram's rich cultural heritage, Poompuhar Handicrafts Emporium offers a treasure trove of traditional handicrafts, sculptures, and artwork. Whether you're searching for a literary gem, a unique piece of art, or a cultural memento, Mamallapuram's shopping landmarks have something for everyone.Affordable Luxury at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceEscape to the enchanting coastal town of Mamallapuram and experience the epitome of luxury at Kaldan Samudhra Palace. With an average price of $205 per room, this opulent hotel offers a truly indulgent stay that is worth every penny. \n\nCompared to the average price of a hotel room in Mamallapuram, which is $98, Kaldan Samudhra Palace provides exceptional value for money. Despite its lavish amenities and world-class services, this hotel goes above and beyond to ensure that guests can enjoy affordable luxury without compromising on quality or comfort. \n\nFrom the moment you step into the grand lobby adorned with exquisite artwork and intricate carvings, you'll be captivated by the regal ambiance that permeates throughout the property. Each room at Kaldan Samudhra Palace is meticulously designed with elegant furnishings, plush bedding, and modern amenities, ensuring a blissful retreat after a day of exploring the city's cultural treasures. So indulge yourself in a truly unforgettable experience at Kaldan Samudhra Palace, where luxury meets affordability in the heart of Mamallapuram.Exquisite Luxury and Exceptional Service at Kaldan Samudhra PalaceNestled in the charming coastal town of Mamallapuram, Kaldan Samudhra Palace is a true gem that offers an unforgettable experience for its guests. With an impressive overall rating of 9.3, this hotel has consistently received rave reviews from satisfied customers. \n\nOne of the standout features of Kaldan Samudhra Palace is its exceptional value for money, earning a remarkable score of 8.8. Guests are delighted by the incredible value they receive for their stay, with top-notch amenities and impeccable service that surpasses their expectations. From the moment you step into the elegant lobby, you'll be greeted with warm smiles and a genuine desire to make your stay truly memorable.\n\nThe hotel's facilities also receive high praise, with a rating of 9.3. Whether you're looking to unwind by the sparkling swimming pool, indulge in a rejuvenating spa treatment, or savor delectable cuisine at the on-site restaurant, Kaldan Samudhra Palace has it all. The attention to detail and commitment to excellence is evident in every aspect of the hotel, ensuring that guests have a truly enriching and enjoyable stay.\n\nIn addition to its outstanding facilities, Kaldan Samudhra Palace is renowned for its impeccable cleanliness, scoring an impressive 9.5. Guests consistently highlight the pristine condition of their rooms and the entire property, creating a serene and comfortable environment that allows them to relax and unwind. The hotel's commitment to maintaining the highest standards of cleanliness is truly commendable and greatly appreciated by its discerning guests.\n\nThe hotel's prime location also contributes to its stellar reputation, earning a rating of 9.3. Situated in the heart of Mamallapuram, guests have easy access to the town's iconic attractions, including the breathtaking Shore Temple and the ancient rock-cut temples. Whether you're a history enthusiast or simply seeking a tranquil beachside getaway, Kaldan Samudhra Palace's prime location ensures that you can easily explore the best that Mamallapuram has to offer.\n\nLast but not least, the staff performance at Kaldan Samudhra Palace is nothing short of exceptional, with a remarkable rating of 9.5. From the friendly and attentive front desk staff to the dedicated housekeeping team, every member of the hotel's staff is committed to providing personalized and attentive service. Guests consistently praise the staff's professionalism, warmth, and willingness to go the extra mile to ensure an unforgettable stay.\n\nWith its exquisite luxury, exceptional service, and outstanding customer ratings, Kaldan Samudhra Palace is the perfect choice for discerning travelers seeking a truly memorable stay in Mamallapuram. Book your stay today and experience the epitome of hospitality.","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":9.1,"worstRating":1,"bestRating":10,"reviewCount":2587},"priceRange":"room rates from ₹16625 per night (INR) - We Price Match!","hasMap":"https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/staticmap?zoom=15&size=504x238&language=en&center=12.646257400512695%2c80.2024154663086&key=AIzaSyC8COgFCyVzK5lDTEqp__tEGkTqRPnIjkM&client=gme-booking&channel=agoda&signature=xHrqk93YlQtHjqpDGXjWT5U1_DI="}


